<map>
	<name> CMP Hatten-Rittershoffen </name>
	<briefing locid="Operation Nordwind, the ambitious German campaign during January 1945 to trap the US 7th Army in the upper reaches of the French province of Alsace is ongoing. During the early hours of Jan 9th 1945, elements of Kampfgruppe Proll started to assault the US soldiers manning the old Maginot forts west of Hatten. Supported by armoured troops and Flammpanzers of Kampfgruppe Huss, the Americans were driven back from the western parts of Hatten. During the next days, an intense battle for control over the two villages developed, with both sides throwing everything they had into the fray. Fierce tank and infantry battles developed in and around the villages, leaving only smoking ruins..">map description for modders maps not localized (english only)</briefing>
<music> Levels/cmp_hatten_rittershoffen/music/Elsaessisches-Fahnenlied.ogg </music>
